53.5rem]/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="user" data-message-id="bbb21446-c14a-4f45-95fd-82107aa95f6b" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5.6-sol-wm" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start"><div class="flex flex-col w-fit max-w-(--user-chat-width,70%) items-start self-end rtl:items-end rtl:self-start"><div class="user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/0.98 relative min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] px-4 py-2.5 leading-6 w-full"><div data-custom-highlighting-behavior="boundary" class="A_HxFq_root" data-collapsed="" data-testid="collapsible-user-message-root" data-can-expand=""><div id="_r_85_" data-testid="collapsible-user-message-content" class="A_HxFq_content"><div class="max-w-full min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] whitespace-pre-wrap">Update the existing DECIMAG landing-page repository.

Do not redesign the page.
Do not change the typography, spacing, colors, layout, animation, wording, or visual hierarchy.
Make only the link and QR-related changes described below.

Repository:
Decimag-landing-page

Published landing-page URL:
https://gadilavi10-pixel.github.io/Decimag-landing-page/

Required changes:

1. Fix the “Watch the film” button

The film file will be uploaded to the repository root with this exact filename:

DECIMAG_v10_DOWNLOAD.mp4

Replace:

href="YOUR_FILM_URL"

with a relative path:

href="./DECIMAG_v10_DOWNLOAD.mp4"

Keep:

target="_blank"
rel="noopener noreferrer"

The final public film URL must resolve to:

https://gadilavi10-pixel.github.io/Decimag-landing-page/DECIMAG_v10_DOWNLOAD.mp4

2. Fix the “Try the interactive demo” button

Replace:

href="YOUR_DEMO_URL"

with:

href="https://gadilavi10-pixel.github.io/Cyber-scenario-demo/"

Keep:

target="_blank"
rel="noopener noreferrer"

3. Preserve the existing links

Do not modify the arXiv link:

https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.24153

Do not modify the Contact mailto link unless it is currently broken.

4. Generate the QR code for the final frame of the film

The QR destination must be exactly:

https://gadilavi10-pixel.github.io/Decimag-landing-page/

Generate both:

- decimag-landing-qr.svg
- decimag-landing-qr.png

QR requirements:

- encode the exact URL above
- high error correction
- black modules on a pure white background
- square format
- no logo inside the QR
- no rounded modules
- no decorative frame
- no caption inside the image
- preserve a proper quiet zone of at least 4 modules
- PNG resolution: at least 1200 × 1200 pixels
- SVG must remain vector-based
- verify the QR by decoding the generated output after creation

5. Replace the final-frame email with the QR code

In the film project, replace the email address in the final DECIMAG frame with the generated QR code.

The final composition must remain:

DECIMAG

Not every authorized action
has the right to act

[QR code centered below]

Final-frame requirements:

- remove the email completely
- do not add a URL as visible text
- center the QR horizontally
- preserve generous empty space around it
- do not add an arrow, label, border, glow, shadow, or decorative container
- keep the background black
- place the QR on a clean white square so the code remains reliably scannable
- keep the QR perfectly static
- keep the final frame visible for at least 6 seconds
- do not animate the QR
- do not alter the existing DECIMAG title or final statement

6. Validate before completion

Test all of the following:

- the landing page loads successfully
- “Watch the film” opens the MP4
- “Try the interactive demo” opens the cyber demo
- the arXiv link works
- Contact works
- the generated QR decodes to the exact landing-page URL
- the QR scans from the exported video while the video is paused
- the QR scans from a normal phone screen
- no placeholder values remain in index.html
- all filenames and URL capitalization match exactly

7. Preserve previous versions

Do not overwrite or delete the previous film export.

Create a new export with a new filename, for example:

DECIMAG_v11_QR.mp4

At the end, report:

- files changed
- files added
- final landing-page URL
- final direct film URL
- final demo URL
- QR destination
- new exported film filename
